  characterLinesName:
  - Bartender
  - Bartender
  - Opponent
  - Opponent
  textLines:
  - Well well, look who's finally returned to the land of the livin'. You really
    thought you could run and drop a dime on everything that's at stake here? That
    hit to the head must've really scrambled somethin' up there.
  - You know the game. You know the rules. Though things never look quite the same
    when you're on the other side of the table, now do they?
  - "Rise and shine, pal. Took a little persuadin\u2019 to get you here, but now
    that you\u2019re awake, let\u2019s deal you in\u2014hope you play better than
    you fight."
  - "This joint\u2019s got history, y\u2019know\u2014lotta poor souls lost more than
    just their wallets at this table. Let\u2019s see if you\u2019re joinin\u2019
    \u2018em."
